WEBVTT

00:00:09,300 --> 00:00:12,020
My granddaughter has issues with her gut.

00:00:12,020 --> 00:00:14,660
Is this a type of patient that you take?

00:00:16,140 --> 00:00:17,420
Yes, it is.

00:00:17,420 --> 00:00:21,020
So we can still help a person like this.

00:00:21,020 --> 00:00:23,100
I mean, it would be like anybody else.

00:00:23,100 --> 00:00:24,700
Go on our website.

00:00:25,820 --> 00:00:28,940
Now you can just click over begin here

00:00:28,940 --> 00:00:30,660
and you'll see schedule down

00:00:30,660 --> 00:00:33,180
and this is what all of you can do.

00:00:33,180 --> 00:00:35,180
The schedule down page will have the option

00:00:35,180 --> 00:00:37,180
to schedule an initial consultation

00:00:37,340 --> 00:00:39,620
or we call a case review.

00:00:39,620 --> 00:00:43,500
You fill out the intake form and you schedule self-schedule.

00:00:43,500 --> 00:00:45,020
Otherwise, you can call the clinic

00:00:45,020 --> 00:00:46,940
and talk to us during the week.

00:00:47,900 --> 00:00:51,420
And this on the schedule down page on our website,

00:00:51,420 --> 00:00:54,380
I didn't make a screenshot of it

00:00:54,380 --> 00:00:57,860
but below here on the page is where you would schedule

00:00:57,860 --> 00:01:02,100
for a follow up visit.

00:01:02,100 --> 00:01:05,060
And that's where again, you could choose to do a Zoom.

00:01:06,060 --> 00:01:08,660
Follow up visit as well.

00:01:08,660 --> 00:01:11,180
But yeah, no matter what health condition

00:01:11,180 --> 00:01:14,900
the person has will still do an initial consultation.

00:01:14,900 --> 00:01:17,860
I may recommend different labs.

00:01:17,860 --> 00:01:20,900
I may recommend getting a course.

00:01:22,380 --> 00:01:24,620
If the person's having gut issues,

00:01:24,620 --> 00:01:26,860
maybe the detox course,

00:01:26,860 --> 00:01:29,260
maybe more likely the autoimmune course

00:01:29,260 --> 00:01:31,100
that's more comprehensive.

00:01:31,100 --> 00:01:33,900
So yeah, we still help people

00:01:34,860 --> 00:01:37,500
with all sorts of different conditions,

00:01:37,500 --> 00:01:40,620
even though we don't attract a lot of people

00:01:40,620 --> 00:01:43,020
with different conditions because our website

00:01:43,020 --> 00:01:44,020
is all about cancer.

00:01:44,020 --> 00:01:49,020
But certainly we have a lot of relatives and patients

00:01:49,740 --> 00:01:52,500
as patients slash members.

00:01:52,500 --> 00:01:56,300
So yep, we're gonna try to help as many people as we can.

